  "bodyHash": "f936db3f9b520864",
  "content": "\n\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n受够了像素化严重、画作数量有限且缺乏合适选择界面的感觉吗？\n《沉浸式绘画》（Immersive Paintings）允许用户通过拖拽、截图\n或提供 URL 来创建具有 Minecraft 风格的自定义画作。\n无需资源包，支持多人游戏且简单易用。\n</p>\n\n<p>该模组提供了一个简单却强大的图形界面，用于选择你自己的画作、其他玩家的画作或通过\n可选数据包提供的画作。内置默认数据包，助你快速上手！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>创作菜单让你能够快速对图像进行像素化处理，并应用后期效果和抖动算法，使其看起来\n完美契合 Minecraft 风格，无需繁琐设置。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>但精美的画作怎能缺少华丽的画框？从多种风格和丰富的材质中选择，让你的\n艺术作品更加引人注目。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>采用智能细节等级（LOD）、缓存和数据懒加载技术，性能影响微乎其微。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>还支持发光颜料！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>图片带有透明背景？没问题，使用涂鸦功能将其喷涂到任何墙面上！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>以下是合成配方。</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_paintings%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersivePaintings%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的合成配方图片\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\">Joy of Painting</a> 兼容！\n只需将画布贴在画上即可展示！\n</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<h1>服务器管理员须知</h1>\n<p>\n《沉浸式绘画》需要传输和存储图像，在服务器上可能会占用大量空间。如果你的服务器面临\n带宽不足或存储空间紧张的问题，请查看\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\">配置文件</a>。\n它提供了一些用户限制和带宽节流选项，以便根据你的需求进行调整。\n</p>\n\n<h1>数据包</h1>\n<p>\n可选地，你可以使用\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\">数据包</a>\n分享画作合集。\n</p>\n\n<h1>语言翻译</h1>\n<p>\n希望模组支持你的语言？请在\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a>\n上帮助翻译该模组\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸式系列模组</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=A%20lot%20of%20unique%20and%20vanilla-faithful%20armor%20sets.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式盔甲\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20aircraft%20to%20travel%2C%20transport%2C%20and%20explore%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式飞行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=Play%20custom%20melodies%20on%20various%20instruments%20and%20annoy%20your%20friends%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式旋律\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=Drag%20and%20drop%2C%20pixelate%20and%20hang%20up%20beautiful%20art.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式绘画\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=A%20lightweight%20entity-tick-scheduler%20for%20doubling%20your%20TPS.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式优化\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides%20the%20ugly%20block%20selection%20outline%20when%20not%20relevant.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"选择性边界\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=A%20set%20of%20additional%20aircraft%20for%20Immersive%20Aircraft%20with%20Create%20support%20in%20mind.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"万机之主\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=A%20bunch%20of%20rustic%20machinery%20to%20transport%2C%20mine%2C%20and%20automate%20things.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式机械\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=Create%20custom%20and%20fancy%20furniture%20in-game%20or%20choose%20from%20a%20vast%20online%20library.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式家具\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=Mysterious%2C%20long-forgotten%20portals%20scattered%20across%20the%20Overworld.&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式传送门\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<h1>附加组件</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful%20Addon&description=32px%20texture%20pack%20addon%20for%20Faithful.&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"忠实材质包附加组件\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/arids-immersive-resprites\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids%20Immersive%20Resprites&description=Resprites%20for%20the%20Immersive%20Melodies%20and%20Immersive%20Paintings%20mods%21&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Arids 沉浸式重绘\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=f79ed7591f3496f8580139e47ae744c3\" alt=\"页面哈希值，便于页面部署。\"/>",
